<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>网站维护中</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: white;
            color: black;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
        }
        
        .maintenance-container {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 600px;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        
        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="maintenance-container">
        <h1>网站正在维护中</h1>
        <p>我们正在对网站进行升级，以提供更好的用户体验</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>